        "classnamespace": "box",
        "rect": [ 85.0, 104.0, 1000.0, 640.0 ],
        "description": "_br.am.example.1.1 -- Created by Brian Riordan, guaguanco127@gmail.com -- https://github.com/guaguanco127/",
        "showrootpatcherontab": 0,
        "showontab": 0,
        "boxes": [
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-signature",
                    "linecount": 2,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 640.0, 15.0, 520.0, 33.0 ],
                    "text": "_br.am.example.1.1 -- Created by Brian Riordan, guaguanco127@gmail.com\nhttps://github.com/guaguanco127/"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 24.0,
                    "id": "obj-1",
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 15.0, 300.0, 33.0 ],
                    "text": "br.am"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-2",
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 57.0, 600.0, 20.0 ],
                    "text": "Stereo tremolo in gen~ that morphs continuously into ring modulation."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-3",
                    "linecount": 4,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 90.0, 600.0, 60.0 ],
                    "text": "Two files, same inlets in the same order. br.am.ui.1.1 has dials and a State outlet: load it in a [bpatcher]. br.am.1.1 is the plain object with no dials: Depth, Ring and Slew go straight into gen~, so they take numbers or signals (see the ring mod tab). Inlets: Left, Right, Modulator (signal 0 to 1), Depth, Ring, Slew. Outlets: Left, Right, and on the .ui, State last."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-4",
                    "linecount": 4,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 160.0, 562.0, 60.0 ],
                    "text": "Inside: gain = (1 - depth) + depth x m. Ring 0 keeps m at 0..1 (tremolo: the dry signal stays in). Ring 1 stretches it to -1..1 (ring mod: the dry pitch cancels, only the sum and difference tones remain). Gain never exceeds 1. Depth and Ring glide 20 ms; Slew rounds the edges of a square or stepped modulator."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-5",
                    "linecount": 4,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 230.0, 560.0, 60.0 ],
                    "text": "Tabs:\n  tremolo: a sine and a square modulator, and Slew de-clicking the square\n  ring mod: an audio-rate modulator; Ring by dial, and by LFO on the plain object\n  State outlet: the tremolo tab's settings, read by name"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-6",
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 300.0, 609.0, 20.0 ],
                    "text": "Each tab has its own source and output. Outputs start muted at -70 dB: turn on audio, then raise the slider slowly."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-7",
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 328.0, 300.0, 20.0 ],
                    "text": "By Brian Riordan. github.com/guaguanco127"
                }
            },
            {
